{
  "appliesTo": {
    "businessTypes": "all",
    "entity": "all"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "You have a name, a logo, colours, type and a voice. This file turns that into files you can actually use, and checks whether it looks professional before you spend money."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "8b795e269c5173ba",
      "id": "intro.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Most small businesses skip this step and then discover the problem at the sign maker, at the printer, or at 3am when a client asks for \"the logo in vector\"."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f99f5bb03372a865",
      "id": "intro.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Words used in this file"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "f8f7e4fc9c5c8540",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Words used in this file"
    },
    {
      "hash": "b2674c649d6feaea",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file.1",
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Plain meanings for the terms used in this file. The full list is in "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Glossary"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "lookup/glossary",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "A logo file that can be made any size without going blurry. SVG, EPS, PDF, AI."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Vector"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "A picture file. Fine for screens. Goes blurry when enlarged. Can have a see-through background."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "PNG"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "No white box around the logo."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Transparent background"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "A fixed arrangement of your mark and your name."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Lockup"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The white version of your logo, for dark backgrounds."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Reversed"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The tiny icon in a browser tab."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Favicon"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "RGB is colour for screens. CMYK is colour for printing. They do not match exactly."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "RGB / CMYK"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Dots per inch. Print needs 300. Web pictures are usually 72 and look blurry printed."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "DPI"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Extra 3mm of colour past the edge of the paper so trimming leaves no white line."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Bleed"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "A numbered system for exact print colours."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Pantone"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The style of lettering."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Typeface / font"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "How easily text can be read against its background."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Contrast"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "kind": "terms"
    },
    {
      "hash": "58b63e273b964039",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file.2",
      "kind": "hr"
    },
    {
      "hash": "58b63e273b964039",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file.3",
      "kind": "hr"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Part 1: the files you must have"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "7b67d9a1b1b99e56",
      "id": "part-1-the-files-you-must-have",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Part 1: the files you must have"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Make these once. Put them in one folder. Send that folder to anyone who makes anything for you."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "ff05423c30e2ac2c",
      "id": "part-1-the-files-you-must-have.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Logo files"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "hash": "f1b6f26b8c6b4884",
      "id": "logo-files",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Logo files"
    },
    {
      "align": [
        null,
        null,
        null
      ],
