            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "PNG, 512 x 512"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The little icon in a browser tab"
            }
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "You also want two arrangements of the same logo, called lockups:"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "a06bb320176fbdcb",
      "id": "logo-files.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Horizontal"
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " — mark next to the name. Use on letterheads, vehicle doors, website headers."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "7b50085079cd5e14",
      "id": "logo-files.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Stacked"
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " — mark above the name. Use in square spaces, social profiles, stamps."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "00314d6e99def6f4",
      "id": "logo-files.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "A logo that only exists in one arrangement will be stretched or squashed by somebody eventually."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "6661f8e27aa705e3",
      "id": "logo-files.5",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Two rules that protect the logo"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "hash": "d0d2c1844d7bbe04",
      "id": "two-rules-that-protect-the-logo",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Two rules that protect the logo"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Clear space."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Decide a minimum empty space around the logo and write it into your brand guide. A simple rule: leave space equal to the height of the first letter on every side. Nothing else goes in that space."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f2d41847b03c2b4f",
      "id": "two-rules-that-protect-the-logo.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Minimum size."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Test how small it can go before it becomes mud. Write that number down, in millimetres for print and pixels for screen. Below that size, use the icon only."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "6de25e5f26fc4233",
      "id": "two-rules-that-protect-the-logo.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Prompt: generate the file checklist for your brand"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "hash": "316a6a580176dd5b",
      "id": "prompt-generate-the-file-checklist-for-your-brand",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Prompt: generate the file checklist for your brand"
    },
    {
      "hash": "1802309ea064c9ef",
      "id": "prompt-generate-the-file-checklist-for-your-brand.1",
      "kind": "code",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "style": "instruction",
          "t": "placeholder",
          "v": "DESCRIBE IT, or say you will attach it"
        },
        {
          "style": "field",
          "t": "placeholder",
          "v": "HEX CODES"
        },
        {
          "style": "field",
          "t": "placeholder",
          "v": "NAMES"
        }
      ],
      "text": "My logo is: [DESCRIBE IT, or say you will attach it]\nMy colours are: [HEX CODES]\nMy typefaces are: [NAMES]\n\nWrite me a one-page \"brand assets\" checklist listing every logo file,\nsize and format I need for a small South African business, and what\neach one is used for.\n\nInclude: vector files, transparent versions, one-colour versions, a\nreversed version, social profile sizes, a favicon, and the two lockups.\n\nThen give me a clear space rule and a minimum size rule for my logo,\nwritten so a printer or sign maker can follow them.\n\nKeep it to one page in simple English.",
      "variant": "prompt"
    },
    {
      "hash": "58b63e273b964039",
      "id": "prompt-generate-the-file-checklist-for-your-brand.2",
      "kind": "hr"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Part 2: print basics that save money"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "e2b1809d12c5b13f",
      "id": "part-2-print-basics-that-save-money",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Part 2: print basics that save money"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Printers ask questions that surprise people. These are the answers."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "79ac872ebab7c8c2",
      "id": "part-2-print-basics-that-save-money.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "RGB or CMYK."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Screens use RGB. Printing uses CMYK. A bright screen colour can print dull and muddy. Ask your printer for a CMYK version of your brand colours, and check a printed proof before you order a thousand of anything."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "fda63409c9530c62",
      "id": "part-2-print-basics-that-save-money.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Resolution."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Print needs 300 DPI. A photo pulled off Facebook is usually 72 DPI and will look blurry printed. Keep your original photo files."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "8897b73df9a5016b",
      "id": "part-2-print-basics-that-save-money.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Bleed."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " If a colour or a photo runs to the edge of the paper, the printer needs 3mm extra beyond the edge to trim into. Ask for \"3mm bleed\" and your artwork will not come back with white slivers on the edges."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "95b59b872722004e",
      "id": "part-2-print-basics-that-save-money.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Pantone."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " If exact colour matters, for example on packaging, ask about a Pantone spot colour. It costs more. For most small businesses it is not needed."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f1a1e8143fd2e5f6",
      "id": "part-2-print-basics-that-save-money.5",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Embroidery."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Shirts and caps need a simple, one-colour, chunky design. Fine lines and small text disappear in thread. This is why the one-colour version of your logo exists."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f077200309c004bc",
      "id": "part-2-print-basics-that-save-money.6",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Vinyl and signage."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Sign makers need vector. A PNG will be refused or will come back with soft edges."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "2fc9488fde1085b9",
      "id": "part-2-print-basics-that-save-money.7",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "hash": "58b63e273b964039",
      "id": "part-2-print-basics-that-save-money.8",
      "kind": "hr"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Part 3: where the brand actually gets used"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "28e23e5a8ad4d991",
      "id": "part-3-where-the-brand-actually-gets-used",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Part 3: where the brand actually gets used"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Work through these in order of how much they earn you. Most one-person businesses should stop after item 6."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "534d433644e30ba9",
      "id": "part-3-where-the-brand-actually-gets-used.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1. WhatsApp Business profile"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "hash": "4b48f9102ed5850d",
      "id": "1-whatsapp-business-profile",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "1. WhatsApp Business profile"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The most-seen thing you own. Square icon version of the logo as the profile picture. Business name, hours, address and a one-line description in your voice."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "4b62a3592191021e",
      "id": "1-whatsapp-business-profile.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2. Google Business Profile"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "hash": "220f8273af5c3598",
      "id": "2-google-business-profile",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "2. Google Business Profile"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Logo, cover photo, and at least ten real photos of real work. See "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Marketing prompts"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "branding/marketing-prompts",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "b59f5c9261d7e4d8",
      "id": "2-google-business-profile.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "3. Your quote and invoice"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "hash": "bc426af0b2b0427c",
      "id": "3-your-quote-and-invoice",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "3. Your quote and invoice"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Logo top left, your colours used sparingly, your body typeface throughout. Nothing else. An invoice is not the place for a design."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "c2570a74bc4e92e2",
      "id": "3-your-quote-and-invoice.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Templates are in "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Which template to use when"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "paperwork/which-template-to-use-when",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". Keep the layout plain and the details correct. A wrong VAT line matters more than a nice header."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "ef6b144368a83031",
      "id": "3-your-quote-and-invoice.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "4. Email signature"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "hash": "7669b81054be492a",
      "id": "4-email-signature",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "4. Email signature"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Name, business name, role, phone, email, website. One line of colour at most. No large images, no quotes, no \"sent from my phone\", no social icons that break in half the email clients."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "e5c9460eed8ff679",
      "id": "4-email-signature.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "5. Vehicle signage"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "hash": "2ec5af700df16ff9",
      "id": "5-vehicle-signage",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "5. Vehicle signage"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Often the cheapest advertising a local business can buy, and a deductible expense."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "eb65313a099dfb99",
      "id": "5-vehicle-signage.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Rules: the phone number is the biggest thing after the name. What you do must be readable in under three seconds from another lane. Two colours maximum. No fine detail. Check your municipal by-laws for size restrictions before you order."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "feb700ff2029fb83",
      "id": "5-vehicle-signage.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "6. Business card"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "hash": "a16035a4793e8ba7",
      "id": "6-business-card",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "6. Business card"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Still useful in South Africa, especially for trades and at markets. Name, what you do, phone, WhatsApp, email. Everything else is optional. A QR code to your WhatsApp is worth more than a website address."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "662e49d99f1a3894",
      "id": "6-business-card.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
