        }
      ],
      "text": "My business is: [BUSINESS TYPE] in [TOWN/CITY], South Africa.\nI am the owner and only worker.\nMy brand guide says: [PASTE THE ONE-PAGE BRAND GUIDE]\n\nList the brand applications I should make, in order of how much each one\nis likely to earn me, for my specific kind of business.\n\nFor each one tell me:\n- What goes on it, exactly\n- What to leave off\n- The file format and size to give the supplier\n- A rough idea of whether this is a do-it-yourself job or a paid job\n- Whether it can wait\n\nBe honest about which ones I do not need. I have very little money.\n\nStop after the list. Do not design anything yet.",
