    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Part 4: the quality tests"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "56f400fc13155b66",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Part 4: the quality tests"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Run every one of these before you spend money. They take ten minutes and they catch almost everything."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f8091fe5932a8180",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The competitor swap test."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Put a competitor's name on your logo, tagline and description. Does it still work? If yes, it is generic."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "c57f1e1148949ab0",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The one-colour test."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Print it in black only. Does it still read? If the design relies on colour to be understood, it will fail on a stamp, a fax, a photocopy and a shirt."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "944274a259f3aef1",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The thumbnail test."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Shrink it to about the size of a WhatsApp profile picture on a phone. Can you still tell what it is?"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "1af71efc92536b6d",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The squint test."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Squint at it until it blurs. Is the shape still distinctive, or does it become a grey blob?"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "e9c52f2292ccffca",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests.5",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The photocopy test."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Print it, photocopy the print, then photocopy the copy. This is what your logo looks like after it has been through three of your customers' offices."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "b674de2a46a83300",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests.6",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The distance test."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Put it on the floor and walk five metres back. This approximates a vehicle passing you."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "b88d4d84bdc8a7af",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests.7",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The phone call test."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Say your business name and web address out loud to someone who has never heard it. Can they spell it back correctly?"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "e1a4a918b958411a",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests.8",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The three-second test."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Show your business card or vehicle to someone for three seconds. Ask what the business does and what the phone number was. If they cannot answer both, there is too much on it."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "7731be23f2401e0e",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests.9",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The consistency test."
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Put your invoice, your business card, your WhatsApp profile and one social post side by side. Do they look like the same business? Inconsistency is the most common reason small brands look amateur, and it costs nothing to fix."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "70372cc75e1b1735",
      "id": "part-4-the-quality-tests.10",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
